Hello {name},
Your bank asks you to confirm the payment of {amount} for invoice {invoice} ({company}). Please complete it here: {link}
Questions? Contact us at {support}.

Hello {name},
We have updated the Vixly Terms of Service (version {version}). As the owner of {company}, please read and accept them by {deadline}: {link}
What changed: {summary}
If they are not accepted by then, your team will have read-only access until you accept. Your customers are not affected.
Questions? Contact us at {support}.

Hello {name},

We made small corrections to the Vixly Terms of Service (version {version}). Nothing to accept; your rights do not change. You can read them here:
{link}

What changed:
{summary}

Questions? Contact us at {support}.

Hello {name},

A contact request arrived from the public site.

Company: {company}
Contact: {contact}
Email: {email}
Phone: {phone}
Country: {country}
Operation: {kind}
Language: {language}

Message:
{message}

Open it in the console: {link}

Hello {name},

{company} ({code}) asked to change its legal details and attached proof.

Review it here: {link}

Hello {name},
Welcome! Setting up {company} is complete: your first computer is enrolled and your company is now active on Vixly.
Your staff sign in here: {staff}
Your customers find you here: {site}
Next steps: add your branches and warehouses, your phone numbers per country, and your logo and colours, from Website and Locations once you are signed in.
Questions? Write to {support}.

Hello {name},
Vixly support approved the reset of your second factor for {company}. Open this link, confirm your email and password, then scan the new code with your authenticator app: {link}
The link works once and expires on {expires} (UTC). If you did not ask for this, contact us right away at {support}.
